  "title": {
   "en": "Akuyaku Reijou no Ane desu ga Mob de Ii no de Shinitakunai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悪役令嬢の姉ですがモブでいいので死にたくない"
   },
   {
    "en": "I'm the Older Sister of a Villainess, but I Don't Want to Die, Even If I'm Just a Mob Character"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Giselle, the older sister of a villainess, faces downfall or death on every route. After remembering her memories from her past life, she begins re-educating her younger sister Odile, who is the source of all evil, to prevent her from becoming a villainess! What's more, Giselle's future fiancé is also a troublesome man who is certain to fall into the dark side...!?",
   "ja": "あらゆるルートで没落か死が待ち受ける悪役令嬢の姉ジゼル。前世の記憶を思い出した彼女は、すべての元凶である妹オディールの“悪役令嬢化”を防ぐため、再教育に取り掛かる！　\nさらにジゼルの未来の婚約者も、闇落ちルート確定の厄介な男で…！？　穏便な暮らしを目指すジゼルの奮闘が始まる──！"
  },
